    "body": "@domenic Please take into consideration that these precedence classes are incredibly ubiquitous. It's a strong signal for spec authors to consider that maybe HTML should step in and offer a standard.\r\n\r\n>no accessibility technology keys off of unknown attributes like this one\r\nWell, that's because it doesn't exist :)\r\n\r\nTabindex is not really the same thing. See reply to @Yay295 \r\n",
